  "limits": [
    "Fresh static byte witness for inline spans, selected words, direct branches and registrations only. No native game/shader execution or full historical LLVM/archive certificate.",
    "Type and field labels are FNV/layout candidates; matching hashes do not exclude collisions or authenticate literal native names.",
    "Constructor defaults and the identified generic loader chain do not establish actual Yi dispatch, later overrides, attachments, sampler state, shader selection or native visual parity.",
    "Compiled alpha normalization by 255 remains a local reader/material policy; this witness establishes constructor byte 5 and alignment, not native upload conversion.",
    "Existing historical LLVM/collector inputs and their missing-archive tests are not replaced or declared restored.",
    "No native actual-Yi dispatch, later override, shader/sampler, upload conversion, attachment orientation or complete visual certificate is claimed.",
    "The previous application certificate remains 3070 passing tests out of 3073, with the same three baseline failures; see pose-history-capture-verification.json."
  ],
  "diagnostics": [
    "Initial inline loader spans have no name key; the witness labels such spans by their recorded address without changing byte/hash checks. Constructor and alignment records are separate to avoid making native defaults depend on generated game profiles."
  ],
